{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09378","headline":"夏至避暑北池 · 韦应物","name":"夏至避暑北池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昼晷已云极，宵漏自此长。\n未及施政教，所忧变炎凉。\n公门日多暇，是月农稍忙。\n高居念田里，苦热安可当。\n亭午息羣物，独游爱方塘。\n门闭阴寂寂，城高树苍苍。\n绿筠尚含粉，圆荷始散芳。\n於焉洒烦抱，可以对华觞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}